# Always deploy

After finishing product or UI changes the user can try in the browser, run `npm run deploy:prod` without waiting to be asked.

Prefer sharing **https://proteinquest.vercel.app** (or the unique `*.vercel.app` deployment URL), not only proteinquest.app, unless they ask for the custom domain.

Do not block on commit/push unless they also asked for that. Store builds stay opt-in.
